WEBVTT

00:00:05.289 --> 00:00:06.009
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:07.009 --> 00:00:12.434
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> What did I do so bad in this world that I deserve this?

00:00:14.475 --> 00:00:15.200
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:16.236 --> 00:00:21.871
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Every time one of the guard would ask me anything, I’d just get a pencil out,

00:00:21.896 --> 00:00:26.714
or a pen or, whatever I had, and write my response.

00:00:28.848 --> 00:00:29.631
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:30.608 --> 00:00:39.057
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I sit back on that little small bed and that’s when I thanked God that my mother was still alive, …

00:00:41.165 --> 00:00:41.885
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:42.952 --> 00:00:47.460
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Two little kids that just, our mothers told us to go out and play,

00:00:47.841 --> 00:00:53.991
and our friendship have lasted for 59 years and Lester and I don’t agree on everything,

00:00:54.016 --> 00:00:57.875
but Lester and I have a bond that is unbreakable.

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:00.814
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:01:01.743 --> 00:01:07.967
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> And all the young men that was around me saw that I was crying …

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:10.746
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:01:11.917 --> 00:01:12.292
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I said,

00:01:12.317 --> 00:01:18.701
‘You telling me that we don’t have to stop at the filling station and ask for directions no more?’